<%# The shell for the save the date and every RSVP step. The shared theme draws an
    engraved card with botanical corners; this theme uses the same hairline grid as
    the rest of the issue, so the forms read as a page rather than a keepsake.

    `floating_assets` is accepted and ignored: scattered snapshots belong to the
    invitation themes, not this one. %>
<div class="editorial-shell max-w-3xl py-4">
  <div class="border-y py-14 lg:py-20" style="border-color: var(--editorial-rule);">
    <%= yield %>
  </div>
</div>
